<title>FRANCE: Big block of LVMH shares traded.</title>
<headline>Big block of LVMH shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 615,000 shares in luxury goods group LVMH changed hands at 1,153 francs per share, totalling some 709 million francs, at 1013 GMT, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
